upervision & ratios"},{"id":"tx-hhsc-94379-i20220818-v4","violation_type_id":"tx-tac-746-1311-a","inspection_id":"tx-hhsc-94379-i20220818","date":"2022-08-18","original_code":"746.1311(a)","severity":"medium","severity_label":"Medium risk","status":"corrected","status_label":"Correction verified 2022-09-15","finding":"Director Annual Training 30 Hours Required: The director had 9 out of the 30 required annual training hours on file. Some but not all of the trainings missing were child maltreatment, communicable diseases including immunizations, food allergies, building and premises safety, and hazardous materials including blood borne pathogens.","topic":"staffing","source_record_id":"1026347877","violation_type_title":"Director Annual Training 30 Hours Required (26 TAC §746.1311(a))","topic_label":"Staff qualifications & clearances"},{"id":"tx-hhsc-94379-i20220818-v5","violation_type_id":"tx-tac-746-4751-b","inspection_id":"tx-hhsc-94379-i20220818","date":"2022-08-18","original_code":"746.4751(b)","severity":"medium","severity_label":"Medium risk","status":"corrected","status_label":"Correction verified 2022-09-15","finding":"Maintenance Procedures for Active Play - Monthly Maintenance Checklist: The operation could not provide daily building and grounds checklist for any weeks or months prior to this week.","topic":"supervision","source_record_id":"1026227388","violation_type_title":"Maintenance Procedures for Active Play - Monthly Maintenance Checklist (26 TAC §746.4751(b))","topic_label":"Supervision & ratios"},{"id":"tx-hhsc-94379-i20220818-v6","violation_type_id":"tx-tac-746-5319","inspection_id":"tx-hhsc-94379-i20220818","date":"2022-08-18","original_code":"746.5319","severity":"high","severity_label":"High risk","status":"corrected","status_label":"Correction verified 2022-09-02","finding":"Smoke Detectors Testing: The operation was not checking the carbon monoxide, fire extinguisher or smoke detector on a monthly basis. The last documented check was  in Sep