03(4)","severity":"high","severity_label":"High risk","status":"corrected","status_label":"Correction verified 2022-08-18","finding":"Responsibilities of Caregivers - Supervision of Children: Based on the information provided during the course of the investigation, staff did not properly supervise a child in care at the end of the day. As a result, the child was left unattended with no adult supervision in the facility until parents arrived.","topic":"supervision","source_record_id":"1026664702","violation_type_title":"Responsibilities of Caregivers - Supervision of Children (26 TAC §746.1203(4))","topic_label":"Supervision & ratios"},{"id":"tx-hhsc-94379-i20220630-v5","violation_type_id":"tx-tac-746-305-a-6","inspection_id":"tx-hhsc-94379-i20220630","date":"2022-06-30","original_code":"746.305(a)(6)","severity":"high","severity_label":"High risk","status":"corrected","status_label":"Correction verified 2022-08-18","finding":"Report Situation Placing Children at Risk: The director failed to properly report an incident that occurred in her facility within the required 48 hours. The report was made approximately one month later.","topic":"staffing","source_record_id":"1026663521","violation_type_title":"Report Situation Placing Children at Risk (26 TAC §746.305(a)(6))","topic_label":"Staff qualifications & clearances"}]}],"geo":{"state":{"code":"TX","name":"Texas"},"county":{"fips":"48355","name":"Nueces County"},"zip":"78405","city":"Corpus Christi"},"related":{"same_operator":[],"same_operator_total":0,"same_building":[],"same_address_other_authority":[],"nearby":[{"id":"tx-hhsc-1503964","name":"Little Disciples Early Learning Center, LLC","type":"center","city":"Corpus Christi","zip":"78416","capacity":91,"violations":0,"open_violations":0,"status":"licensed","distance_km":0.64},{"id":"tx-hhsc-1512955","name":"Upbring Head Start (Stepping Stone)","type":"center","city":"Corpus Christi","zip":"78415","capacity":31,"violations":2,"open_violations":0,"status":"license